{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/extras/1410f4572f0ac599bec6de3596136515.avif?t=1758851597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EONIA REVELATIONS \u2014 By the Talented Lanio Landelion, Perfect, Sublime, and Magnificent Writer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this epic tale, you, humble player, shall assume the role of Blin Albius, the last apprentice on the path to becoming a Knowledge Seeker. Oh, what a noble title! Your mission shall be nothing less than to catalog exotic plants, minerals, and creatures that inhabit the vast and colorful world of EONIA. A world that, naturally, can only be compared to the greatness of my imagination. And as with everything touched by my quill, you shall uncover the truth \u2014 the Truth! \u2014 behind the mighty powers that govern this universe and the secrets that rule it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY \u2014 A symphony of activities worthy of my intellect!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a rich, varied, and absolutely dazzling experience. You will freely explore this fantastic world, gathering exotic ingredients from flora, fauna, and minerals that would make any geologist weep with joy. You\u2019ll solve puzzles as intricate as my prose, craft potions that dare to rival my eloquence, chart maps with precision befitting my genius, read books (written with my perfection!), learn skills, travel through ancient portals, sail across captivating waters, and encounter intriguing and amusing characters \u2014 some even ridiculously so! Of course, not because of me! Blasphemy! You\u2019ll explore caves, valleys, deserts, and dunes, build bridges and contraptions, fish elusive creatures, face dangerous beasts, and wield energy crystals as powerful as my intellect. And yes, there\u2019s even more. But I wouldn\u2019t want to overwhelm you with such a flood of brilliance all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY \u2014 A plot as deep as my extreme humility!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find yourself amidst rivalries and shadowy alliances, and you shall learn the truth \u2014 that truth which only the chosen can bear \u2014 about the powers that claim dominion over the world. You\u2019ll interact with factions that, while not as fascinating as myself, still possess considerable charm. Everything revolves around a central mystery, with hidden secrets and the possibility that ancient forces or forbidden technologies continue to shape the fate of EONIA. The rich and elaborate narrative (which includes my perfect texts, of course!) speaks of the search for legacies left by forgotten beings (unlike me, who shall never be forgotten!) and the interpretation of prophecies that could alter the course of the world. What a glorious responsibility awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EONIA REVELATIONS is not merely a game. It is a journey! A complete immersion into a world so beautiful and magnificent because I dwell within it. Well, there are other beautiful and magnificent things too, of course. Each discovery you face will bring you closer to the final revelation. Are you prepared to unravel the secrets? To walk paths that only the bravest \u2014 and the wisest, like me \u2014 dare to tread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onward, player! Let your journey begin. And remember: do not be discouraged! For perhaps, one day, with much, much effort, you may come close to reaching my perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanio Landelion, perfect, sublime, and magnificent writer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2487710?t=1758851597","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/1b9a1146bdd4790695c2cdf22b4bb1cc846faa7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758851597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/96a01273369bad3367c5910558d48ef2fc8cd4ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758851597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/96a01273369bad3367c5910558d48ef2fc8cd4ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758851597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/extras/1410f4572f0ac599bec6de3596136515.avif?t=1758851597\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EONIA REVELATIONS \u2014 By the Talented Lanio Landelion, Perfect, Sublime, and Magnificent Writer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this epic tale, you, humble player, shall assume the role of Blin Albius, the last apprentice on the path to becoming a Knowledge Seeker. Oh, what a noble title! Your mission shall be nothing less than to catalog exotic plants, minerals, and creatures that inhabit the vast and colorful world of EONIA. A world that, naturally, can only be compared to the greatness of my imagination. And as with everything touched by my quill, you shall uncover the truth \u2014 the Truth! \u2014 behind the mighty powers that govern this universe and the secrets that rule it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY \u2014 A symphon