><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EONIA REVELATIONS is not merely a game. It is a journey! A complete immersion into a world so beautiful and magnificent because I dwell within it. Well, there are other beautiful and magnificent things too, of course. Each discovery you face will bring you closer to the final revelation. Are you prepared to unravel the secrets? To walk paths that only the bravest \u2014 and the wisest, like me \u2014 dare to tread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onward, player! Let your journey begin. And remember: do not be discouraged! For perhaps, one day, with much, much effort, you may come close to reaching my perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanio Landelion, perfect, sublime, and magnificent writer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p>","developers":["GEOMETRIC BYTES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/b49f88c2dabb6d9752c2dc23334715c68d331d13/header.jpg?t=1758851597","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright GEOMETRIC BYTES","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2487710/1279646392/e190f537a1782843032d6873c9de81f2aa1b85a1/1758730613/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758733637","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2487710/1279646392/e190f537a1782843032d6873c9de81f2aa1b85a1/1758730613/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758733637","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2487710/1279646392/e190f537a1782843032d6873c9de81f2aa1b85a1/1758730613/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758733637","id":257205563,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205563/movie480.mp4?t=1758733637","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor